# Port to listen on
PORT=8787

# Comma-separated list of extra directories to load plugins from, in addition to the
# bundled plugins/ directory (unless DISABLE_BUNDLED_PLUGINS is set). Each directory is
# scanned recursively: every .json file is loaded as one or more data-driven RegexPlugins
# (see src/plugins/regex-plugin.ts), and every .js file is dynamically imported as a
# code-based ReceiptPlugin -- the advanced escape hatch. .js files run as trusted code with
# full Node.js access; only point this at directories you trust.
# PLUGIN_DIRS=/path/to/more-plugins

# If "true", skip the bundled plugins/ directory entirely -- only PLUGIN_DIRS is loaded.
# Useful for running with a fully custom charity list instead of the bundled defaults.
# DISABLE_BUNDLED_PLUGINS=true
